t":"为凉州别驾，守上邽令。","evidence":["lizang-q2-b0d9deeec9da997c297c"]}],"aliases":[],"mentions":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"lizang-q-4b598c453181a0006fb3","section":"chapter-018","block":"b-8932614afb714115ca85","layer":"original","quote":"温向城大呼曰：“大军不过三日至，勉之！”城中皆泣，称“万岁","section_title":"二李臧文吕许典二庞阎传第十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0041.xhtml","index":249,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":152,"end":181,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"lizang-q-51ac58cebb7949befdf7","section":"chapter-018","block":"b-8932614afb714115ca85","layer":"original","quote":"超怒数之曰：“足下不为命计邪？”温不应。时超攻城，久不下；故徐诱温，冀其改意。复谓温曰：“城中故人，有欲与吾同者不？”温又不应。遂切责之，温曰：“夫事君有死无贰，而卿乃欲令长者出不义之言，吾岂苟生者乎！”超遂杀之","section_title":"二李臧文吕许典二庞阎传第十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0041.xhtml","index":249,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":186,"end":292,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"lizang-q-7353c01a1daa2f45e5e5","section":"chapter-018","block":"b-8932614afb714115ca85","layer":"original","quote":"州乃遣温密出，告急于夏侯渊。贼围数重，温夜从水中潜出","section_title":"二李臧文吕许典二庞阎传第十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0041.xhtml","index":249,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":12,"end":38,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"lizang-q-79e2d5a338348a8c5b69","section":"chapter-018","block":"b-8932614afb714115ca85","layer":"original","quote":"超解其缚，谓曰：“今成败可见，足下为孤城请救而执于人手，义何所施？若从吾言，反谓城中‘东方无救〖3〗’，此转祸为福之计也。不然，今为戮矣！”温伪许之，超乃载温诣城下","section_title":"二李臧文吕许典二庞阎传第十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0041.xhtml","index":249,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":69,"end":151,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"lizang-q-7bff386637620838822f","section":"chapter-018","block":"b-8932614afb714115ca85","layer":"original","quote":"明日，贼见其迹，遣人追遮之〖2〗。于显亲界，得温，执还诣超","section_title":"二李臧文吕许典二庞阎传第十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0041.xhtml","index":249,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":39,"end":68,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"lizang-q-7da87416257c3a3ae30d","section":"chapter-018","block":"b-4d8ac8a06f8627fc68b2","layer":"original","quote":"马超走奔上邽，郡人任养等举众迎之","section_title":"二李臧文吕许典二庞阎传第十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0041.xhtml","index":248,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":28,"end":44,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"lizang-q-89dfdfaa72b81fe3750d","section":"chapter-018","block":"b-8932614afb714115ca85","layer":"original","quote":"超复围州所治冀城，甚急","section_title":"二李臧文吕许典二庞阎传第十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0041.xhtml","index":249,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":11,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"lizang-q-b37557f0c09488a8da08","section":"chapter-018","block":"b-4d8ac8a06f8627fc68b2","layer":"original","quote":"温止之，不能禁，乃驰还州","section_title":"二李臧文吕许典二庞阎传第十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0041.xhtml","index":248,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":45,"end":57,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"lizang-q2-b0d9deeec9da997c297c","section":"chapter-018","block":"b-4d8ac8a06f8627fc68b2","layer":"original","quote":"阎温字伯俭，天水西（城）人也〖1〗。以凉州别驾守上邽令。马超走奔上邽，郡人任养等举众迎之；温止之，不能禁，乃驰还州。","section_title":"二李臧文吕许典二庞阎传第十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0041.xhtml","index":248,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":58,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xinyang-q-e8cb2490ce111c7c32b4","section":"chapter-025","block":"b-6677f0d0806a149bfd99","layer":"original","quote":"超尽兼陇右之众，而张鲁又遣大将杨昂以助之，凡万余人，攻城。阜率国士大夫及宗族子弟胜兵者千余人〖15〗，使从弟岳于城上作偃月营〖16〗，与超接战，自正月至八月拒守，而救兵不至。州遣别驾阎温循水潜出求救〖17〗，为超所杀，于是刺史、太守失色，始有降超之计。阜流涕谏曰：“阜等率父兄子弟以义相励，有死无二；田单之守〖18〗，不固于此也。弃垂成之功，陷不义之名，阜以死守之。”遂号哭。刺史、太守卒遣人请和，开城门迎超。","section_title":"辛毗杨阜高堂隆传第二十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0056.xhtml","index":124,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":205,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
